{"version":1,"content":"<p>SpaceX旗下衞星互聯網服務Starlink正在擴大其類似網約車「高峯加價」的定價策略範圍。根據最新政策，美國更多地區的用户在開通服務時將面臨根據當地網絡容量狀況動態調整的費用，而部分熱門區域的收費漲幅已經超過100%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585508.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.575851+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T15:17:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"e1c5074b339d3a098fe98f01967efec34aa1c0f9534cfb23a43a07f62cb8d312","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}